sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-economou-palate-ruguga-turing> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-economou-palate-ruguga-turing-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-economou-palate-ruguga-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Economou et al. (2012) FGF10/FGF7-SHH activator-inhibitor Turing stripe mechanism at mammalian palatal growth zones — MorphoEval overall 54.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2012-economou-palate-ruguga-turing.py` (overall weighted score: 56.2/100). The v1 script constructs the 2-component FGF-SHH activator-inhibitor reaction Jacobian J_0, evaluates the Turing dispersion relation Re(sigma(q)), and integrates a static 1D domain producing 9 in-phase FGF and SHH peaks (r_AH > 0.95), but lacks a 2D growing palatal shelf PDE with a localized ruga-8 anterior growth zone driving sequential `8 -> 1..7b` stripe intercalation, omits the coronal vs sagittal surgical cuts and cyclopamine/FGF10-bead perturbations, and does not segment the vendored mammalian hard palate rugae specimen. Overall 54.3/100 (faithfulness 47.6, reproducibility 70.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 45d4150; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 47, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/palate_ruguga_turing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-economou-palate-ruguga-turing.py at 45d4150, image/png, 306096 B, 1570×1154 px, artifact_sha256 84f9f694133a1960368ee29f3f1b0be40f48322224ea9dfdb3cdb2d6a45a64dc (sha256 84f9f694133a1960368ee29f3f1b0be40f48322224ea9dfdb3cdb2d6a45a64dc), spec_fingerprint 2d8b918612b8f3a25ba7f27439207d03bf556187e2f521ce737d04a76d0c39ef. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2d8b918612b8f3a25ba7f27439207d03bf556187e2f521ce737d04a76d0c39ef; artifact_sha256: 84f9f694133a1960368ee29f3f1b0be40f48322224ea9dfdb3cdb2d6a45a64dc; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/palate_rugae_specimen.jpg=a38f6c053ffe9048..., datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/palate_ruguga_turing_reference.json=e76e670dd50c86fe..., datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/paper_citations.bib=fd020997fb3c2db0..., datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/scout_manifest.json=f0a345a5c9039e78...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 files in `datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/`, expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--a11`, `--a12`, `--a21`, `--a22`, `--D-ratio`, `--growth-rate`, `--seed`), and expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 metrics and `self_test()` to 8 comprehensive checks.",
            "remediation needed: Implement a 1D & 2D growing palatal shelf reaction-diffusion PDE solver with a localized ruga-8 anterior growth zone that sequentially intercalates rugae in the developmental order `8 -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> 6 -> 7 -> 7b` alongside the equal-diffusion (D_A = D_H = 0.2) negative control.",
            "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision DoG ridge segmentation of `datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/palate_rugae_specimen.jpg` across both the left palatal shelf (`[320, 220, 420, 1760]`, 15 rugae) and right palatal shelf (`[500, 220, 600, 1760]`, 16 rugae) to quantify empirical transverse ruga count, inter-ruga AP wavelength spacing, and CV.",
            "remediation needed: Simulate the full 6-condition surgical and pharmacological perturbation suite of Economou et al. (2012) Figs. 2-4: Wild-Type intact palate (9 transverse rugae), Sagittal surgical cut (AP-parallel incision preserving stripe orientation), Coronal surgical cut across the ruga-8 growth zone (releasing SHH inhibition to trigger ruga bifurcation and spots), Cyclopamine SHH blockade (broadened/merged rugae), Exogenous FGF10 bead / Spry2-/-;Spry4+/- FGF hyperactivation (high-density ectopic rugae/repulsion), and Equal-Diffusion negative control (0 rugae)." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.543"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 008 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

